3. Preset Buffer Bounds Overflows: While loadPreset() checks y < this.rows && x < this.cols, presets with dynamic translations could potentially encounter negative indices or out-of-bounds array writes if grid dimensions are altered dynamically during viewport resizing. Array access must be guarded by strict boundary clamping (0 <= x < cols and 0 <= y < rows)."
